            "matched_surface": "sigmoid",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_25d8fe5a35598915ef7691a9",
            "source_text": "### Sigmoid Function",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_generative_adversarial_networks_gan_b008",
            "boundary_only": false,
            "chapter_id": "d2l_generative_adversarial_networks",
            "content_sha256": "a471e0b4dafebce9658d765f9ca8ffbd450659d826eb8ee8dc88a6e24ce80766",
            "context_id": "ctx_6fba33e1194891da74822687",
            "evidence_roles": [
              "POSITIVE_DEFINITION_PROPOSAL",
              "POSITIVE_POS_PROPOSAL",
              "PRIMARY"
            ],
            "matched_surface": "sigmoid",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_265b9c5d6489e7d62400252e",
            "source_text": "Typically, the discriminator outputs a scalar prediction $o\\in\\mathbb R$ for input $\\mathbf x$, such as using a dense layer with hidden size 1, and then applies sigmoid function to obtain the predicted probability $D(\\mathbf x) = 1/(1+e^{-o})$.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
