            "matched_surface": "zero mean",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_319626f740e5c0a7934d3dbc",
            "source_text": "Typically, the Xavier initialization\nsamples weights from a Gaussian distribution\nwith zero mean and variance\n$\\sigma^2 = \\frac{2}{n_\\mathrm{in} + n_\\mathrm{out}}$.",
            "synthetic": false
