            "matched_surface": "skip-gram model",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_8a29c3fc7bf547fdd4b023f0",
            "source_text": "In the skip-gram model, each word\nhas two $d$-dimensional-vector representations\nfor calculating conditional probabilities.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_natural_language_processing_pretraining_word2vec_b032",
            "boundary_only": false,
            "chapter_id": "d2l_natural_language_processing_pretraining",
            "content_sha256": "d520a84526c732a100d01121a20c9691e75b37a22fc9bc41ea4828d46b2e0aa3",
            "context_id": "ctx_0cbd6b544c567ce5e0d6a15e",
            "evidence_roles": [
              "POSITIVE_DEFINITION_PROPOSAL",
              "PRIMARY"
            ],
            "matched_surface": "skip-gram model",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_d817077031ebd0ab4c570d0a",
            "source_text": "The major difference\nfrom the skip-gram model is that\nthe continuous bag of words model\nassumes that a center word is generated\nbased on its surrounding context words in the text sequence.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_natural_language_processing_pretraining_word2vec_b023",
            "boundary_only": false,
            "chapter_id": "d2l_natural_language_processing_pretraining",
            "content_sha256": "f5cd6a909d1f423e4f2a23dc5be791547e16adbd81966dec45becfc032e5fbb9",
            "context_id": "ctx_35d82b9dff7df8ff9a2c49cd",
            "evidence_roles": [
              "POSITIVE_POS_PROPOSAL",
              "PRIMARY"
            ],
            "matched_surface": "skip-gram model",
            "positive_evidence_eligible": true,
            "sentence_id": "sentence_0d8dee004eaf705069b266b2",
            "source_text": "The skip-gram model parameters are the center word vector and context word vector for each word in the vocabulary.",
            "synthetic": false
          },
          {
            "block_id": "d2l_natural_language_processing_pretraining_word2vec_b011",
